# maintainer's private companion repository, and never reaches the public
# snapshot, which scripts/assemble-public-tree.sh builds with `git archive`.
# The snapshot machinery itself stays private too. That script also fails
# when any of these paths, or any ignored local-only directory, appears in the
# assembled tree, so add each new export-ignore path to its forbidden list.
